stage: 2
theme: underground
music: underground
time: 400
start: 1,3
startMode: fall
camera: scroll
;; Campaign play only (level/campaign.ts applyLook): Samus's tribute, 4-2's underground as
;; Metroid's Brinstar: the same tiles, enemies, coins and collision in the `brinstar` theme and
;; music, with brush and rock pillars ([campaign-decor]; the warp room is left bare for Larry's
;; anchor). Since 0.4.27 (World 4 as Zebes) its overworld ends (4-2-intro, 4-2-exit) and the
;; vine's warp room are Zebes's surface (`crateria`) and its bonus room Brinstar too; Samus's
;; cavern and Larry's airship keep their own looks. Elsewhere (level select, ?level=4-2) it looks
;; as it always did.
campaignTheme: brinstar
campaignMusic: brinstar

