;; Campaign only (0.4.23, docs/STORY.md 2.7): the bird statue, moved from 4-1's pipe room, on the
;; floor past the lift's pit (57-62), just past the vine block (64) up to the vine area's dead pipe.
partner 65 12 who=chozo campaign=true

[zones]
checkpoint 98 12
vine 64 5 -> 4-2-warp 4 14
pipe 84 10 down -> 4-2-bonus 1 0 exit=none
pipe 187 9 right -> 4-2-exit 3 10 exit=up
pipe 214 10 down -> 5-1 2 12
;; Campaign play (owner decisions): the room looks classic but its pipe is dead (no pipe zone);
;; once the hero has dropped in and stands on the floor, Larry Koopa's anchor crashes down through
;; the ceiling, smashes the pipe and rests where it stood, its chain rising off the top of the
;; screen; climbing it arrives on the airship's bow (`4-2-airship`, the chain at column 2, landing
;; on the deck in column 3; an area of 4-2: no map road of its own; level/campaign.ts). With
;; `larry` on the file (the airship crashed) only the pipe's stump is left. Other play keeps the
;; warp to 5-1.
warp 208 16 worlds=5 text=WELCOME_TO_WARP_ZONE! goto=4-2-airship,2,3,climb until=larry

